{% comment %}
  Renders a ZINSETT BadgePill (Design Brief §5 `BadgePill`, §6 Collection).

  Sale and sold-out pills reuse Dawn's existing `settings.sale_badge_color_scheme`
  (scheme-4 / terra, Brief §2.1 color/terra) and `settings.sold_out_badge_color_scheme`
  (scheme-3 / muted, Brief §2.1 color/muted) so merchants keep one control surface
  (Theme settings > Badges) while every call site renders the same pill markup.
  Pill radius/typography come from Dawn's `--badge-corner-radius` custom property
  (theme setting, already at its 40px max = a true pill at badge scale) and the
  shared `.badge` component styles — no hardcoded hex here.

  Accepts:
  - id: {String} DOM id for the badge; referenced by the card title's aria-labelledby
  - text: {String} already-translated label text (e.g. `'products.product.on_sale' | t`)
  - scheme: {String} color scheme id, e.g. settings.sale_badge_color_scheme

  Usage:
  {% render 'badge-pill', id: badge_id, text: 'products.product.on_sale' | t, scheme: settings.sale_badge_color_scheme %}
{% endcomment %}
<span id="{{ id }}" class="badge badge--bottom-left color-{{ scheme }}">{{- text -}}</span>
